<title>FINLAND: Merita to issue FIM 2.0 bln bond.</title>
<headline>Merita to issue FIM 2.0 bln bond.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish banking group Merita Oy said on Tuesday its bank Merita Pankki Oy was issuing a 2.0 billion markka bond mainly to institutional investors.</p>
<p>&quot;The bond, mainly targeted at the wholesale market, matures on September 15, 2001,&quot; Merita said.  </p>
<p>The bond carries a 5.50 percent coupon and will be issued at floating prices,mainly in auctions to be announced later, Merita said.</p>
<p>Merita said it would apply for a listing for the bond on the Helsinki Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
